  "description": "RabbitMQ: native broker metrics (per-stream publish/deliver rates, retry and DLQ depth, unroutable publishes) scraped from the rabbitmq_prometheus plugin, plus the Polaris-side publish-failure proxy and the authoritative processor lag signal. See infra/prometheus/prometheus.yml (job polaris-rabbitmq).",
